{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21215","headline":"三叹 三 · 元稹","name":"三叹 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天骥失龙偶，三年常夜嘶。\n哀缘喷风断，渴且含霜啼。\n长恐绝遗类，不复蹑云霓。\n非无駉駉者，鹤意不在鸡。\n春来筋骨瘦，吊影心亦迷。\n自此渥洼种，应生浊水泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}